<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Adora's Big Announcement and Unexpected Visitors to Bright Moon</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Horde Prime has finally been defeated and the war has ended. Everyone is overjoyed. Adora has a momentous announcement to make to the fellow princesses and... it involves her feline friend (or more than a friend). During their meeting, back in Bright Moon, two girls, one with puffy pink hair (like cotton candy), and another with short blue hair, appear, seemingly out of nowhere. Adora and her friends try to figure out what they should do with these two spice girls. All the while the fellow princesses, and their friends, are happy for Adora and new partner. This leads to merriment with plans for a celebration, as friendship with the two spice girls blossoms as the time passes.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>lefemmerouge2</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
